Well, isn't that special?

250
00:14:36,060 --> 00:14:40,600
It appears I'll be able to destroy Yugi
even sooner than I thought I would.

251
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:41,960
Not quite!

252
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:45,500
Your dark shadow powers
will never penetrate me!

253
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:48,160
I will shield everyone from your evil!

254
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:54,077
I doubt it.

255
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:58,617
nothing can withstand the unstoppable
force of the greatest creature to

256
00:14:58,700 --> 00:15:04,700
ever walk the earth the winged dragon
of ra all three of you are finished

257
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:19,940
oh no yuki help him please get off don't
worry yuke you're gonna be all right

258
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:25,100
That's what you think, fool,
but I'm afraid I beg to differ.

259
00:15:25,460 --> 00:15:27,048
Looks like I won this duel.

260
00:15:27,420 --> 00:15:28,360
I'm waiting.

261
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:32,641
Her life points are gone, so announce
me as the winner immediately.

262
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:35,260
The winner of this duel is Mr.

263
00:15:35,460 --> 00:15:36,520
Merrick Ishtam.

264
00:15:37,760 --> 00:15:40,900
Let's check the damage
and cause some more.

265
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:44,520
Yugi, come on. Get up, pal.

266
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:46,217
What do we have here?

267
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:50,180
I should send him to the
Shadow Realm right now.

268
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:51,320
You wish.

269
00:15:51,660 --> 00:15:53,560
Relax, I still need him.

270
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:56,040
But you're not so fortunate.

271
00:15:56,340 --> 00:16:01,281
And you need to be taught a lesson about
meddling in matters that don't concern you.

272
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,760
This should hold you.

273
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,040
I can't move.

274
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:08,900
Perhaps next time you'll think
before you enter a duel uninvited.

275
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:10,510
Joey!

276
00:16:10,660 --> 00:16:12,580
What did you do to him, Merrick?

277
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:14,040
Not to worry.

278
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:17,697
He'll be fine, but there's
something we need to discuss.

279
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:22,720
You still have my Egyptian god card
in your deck, and I want it back.

280
00:16:23,060 --> 00:16:25,400
Now it's time to fulfill my promise.

281
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:29,817
I said if you lost, you'd be trapped
in the Shadow Realm for eternity.

282
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:30,980
The Shadow Realm?

283
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,720
Did you forget?

284
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:36,942
I know your memory has failed you,
but you and I had an agreement.

285
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,470
So...

286
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:43,410
Where am I?

287
00:16:43,493 --> 00:16:45,220
And where did everybody go?

288
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:51,020
Look out, guys, because here come
the wheelies. Come on, get in! Hey!

289
00:16:54,580 --> 00:16:56,740
Guys, please, help me!

290
00:16:57,340 --> 00:16:59,880
Scream all you want, they can't hear you.

291
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:05,100
But they seem to be having fun, and
they don't miss you at all, my dear.

292
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:08,600
Now are you beginning to
understand where you are?

293
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:10,497
It's sort of a living nightmare.

294
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:14,560
You'll be completely alone
for the rest of eternity.

295
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:18,026
And here you'll sit day
after day in isolation

296
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:21,080
as your friends disappear one by one.

297
00:17:21,500 --> 00:17:22,560
Oh, no!

298
00:17:23,260 --> 00:17:26,520
I hope you enjoy your
stay in the Shadow Realm.

299
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:28,680
Oh, and one last thing.

300
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,680
I'm taking back my car.

301
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:37,840
Hey, Mike.

302
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:42,260
Joey, don't leave me
here. Later. No! Please!

303
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:44,640
Papa! Papa!

304
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:50,730
My!

305
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:54,180
Tell me what you did to her now, Marek.

306
00:17:54,300 --> 00:17:57,880
Your friend made a costly
mistake by dueling against me.

307
00:17:58,100 --> 00:18:01,100
And now I'm afraid she's
paying the ultimate price.

308
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:03,261
Notice her motionless appearance?

309
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,700
That's because her mind is trapped.

310
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:06,800
Say, what?

311
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:09,577
With each passing
second, she forgets more.

312
00:18:09,660 --> 00:18:12,420
The shadows are taking
everything, Wheeler.

313
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:15,440
Her family, her friends,

314
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:20,000
everything she kept inside
her mind and inside her heart.

315
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,160
That's it, Merrick.

316
00:18:22,300 --> 00:18:23,712
Now you've gone too far.

317
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,680
So it's go time.

318
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:27,580
Now put him up, cowboy.

319
00:18:28,180 --> 00:18:32,239
Fool, threaten me again and you'll
meet the same fate as your friend.

320
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:35,640
Joey, please, just let it go.

321
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,060
She's right, man.

322
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:38,593
This creep's psychotic.

323
00:18:42,060 --> 00:18:44,920
I can feel the power within me growing.

324
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:49,800
With each mind I send to the shadows,
the darkness within me increases.

325
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:55,337
Come on, Mai, snap out of it.

326
00:18:55,420 --> 00:18:57,080
Yugi, you've got to get up.

327
00:18:57,400 --> 00:19:02,237
I'm sorry I let you down, Mai, but I promise
I'm going to get you out of this mess.

328
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:04,180
Hey, guys, Yugi's waking up.

329
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:06,840
Are you all right?

330
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:08,190
Yugi!

331
00:19:08,273 --> 00:19:09,274
Don't worry, I'm fine.

332
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:11,131
But are you and Mai okay?

333
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,380
I'm fine.

334
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:14,780
But Mai's not doing so well.

335
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:18,057
Marek pulled something freaky
with that Millennium Rod.

336
00:19:18,140 --> 00:19:20,637
He said he trapped her
brain in the shadows.

337
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:23,657
Yeah, and then he said she's
gonna lose all her memories.

338
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:24,720
Seto, come in.

339
00:19:25,340 --> 00:19:26,170
Proceed.

340
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,280
I have an update.

341
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:30,337
There's more written on this
card than just that chance.

342
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:32,244
I'll decode the text right now.

343
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:33,600
Okay, good work.

344
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,860
We need to find out all
the secrets of this card.

345
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:38,697
All right, you geeks.

346
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:40,960
Clear the field for the next duel.

347
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:42,800
Kaiba, save it.

348
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:46,814
I'm dueling next, and I need
to prepare the field, Yugi.

349
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:49,620
So that the torment can begin.
